{"id":"bijou","lemma":"bijou","pos":"noun","rank":1956,"glosses":["a piece of jewelry"],"ipa":"/bi.ʒu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/Fr-bijou.ogg/Fr-bijou.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bijoux"},"formAudio":{"bijoux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-bijoux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un bijou de famille.","en":"It's a family heirloom.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"family"}]},{"text":"Vendez-vous des bijoux ?","en":"Do you sell jewelry?","words":[{"g":"to sell","l":"vendre"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Il est présumé avoir volé les bijoux.","en":"He is alleged to have stolen the jewelry.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to presume, assume","l":"présumer"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to fly through the air","l":"voler"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Ces bijoux sont chers.","en":"These jewels are expensive.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"dearly, expensively","l":"cher"}]},{"text":"Il enferma ses bijoux dans le coffre.","en":"He locked up his jewels in the safe.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to lock up","l":"enfermer"},{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"chest, box"}]}]}